    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and multiplayer features. Explore an open-world while completing quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends with the realm editor.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SMASH MOBS!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Why not XP farm on some mobs before you try your luck on a dragon? Watch out, some monsters are aggressive!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COLLECT RESOURCES!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Collecting resources is easy enough from the safety provided by town walls, but beware of venturing in the wilderness unprepared.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD STRUCTURES!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f4b3c9ca8bea61231f4791d647a8c3bd.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f4b3c9ca8bea61231f4791d647a8c3bd.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f4b3c9ca8bea61231f4791d647a8c3bd.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Create your environment on demand! Building within towns can be limited by property ownership. Players can buy, sell or lease plots within towns for item storage and other conveniences.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVEL SKILLS!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/259343d85ff5582f46556b3c1067dde7.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/259343d85ff5582f46556b3c1067dde7.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/259343d85ff5582f46556b3c1067dde7.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/b7cbcda24f96887547d5e242a3e8912b.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/b7cbcda24f96887547d5e242a3e8912b.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/b7cbcda24f96887547d5e242a3e8912b.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Level up your combat and non-combat skills and gain access to new content for resources or money making strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPONS &amp; ARMOR!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/36f7dfa4e071c72e9a3b3e818ea60ce2.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/36f7dfa4e071c72e9a3b3e818ea60ce2.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equip yourself for your battles freely. Armor and weapons provide different bonuses, results can be positive and/or negative for certain styles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TECHNICAL DETAILS!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ygg Engine includes the Ygg game client, Ygg game server, and Ygg realm editor.<br></li><li> Ygg Engine runs as a client and server, which can be limited to single-player or opened for multi-player<br></li><li> You can host public Ygg game servers that others can join<br></li><li> Custom Map size maximum is 16-Million tiles<br></li><li> Ygg Client supports 2x and 4x zoom, natively runs at 1366x768 resolution, rendering 1125 tiles on the screen at a time<br></li><li> Steam deck support with adjusted resolution is planned<br></li><li> Entity movement updates can be toggled between animated and instant on demand<br></li><li> New server and client features being added regularly!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a0503e85dd54c8c7272a5fc0acf99d01.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and multiplayer features. Explore an open-world while completing quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends with the realm editor.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SMASH MOBS!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc7cd7d5736f8b2f77fac024bca741d1.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Why not XP farm on some mobs before you try your luck on a dragon? Watch out, some monsters are aggressive!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COLLECT RESOURCES!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/2a6a4e5f6a701cc5a876bdcd16acfa0c.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c4b185548bc9eef0d9b13da02f9a8b35.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Collecting resources is easy enough from the safety provided by town walls, but beware of venturing in the wilderness unprepared.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD STRUCTURES!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f4b3c9ca8bea61231f4791d647a8c3bd.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f4b3c9ca8bea61231f479