.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPONS &amp; ARMOR!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/36f7dfa4e071c72e9a3b3e818ea60ce2.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/36f7dfa4e071c72e9a3b3e818ea60ce2.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equip yourself for your battles freely. Armor and weapons provide different bonuses, results can be positive and/or negative for certain styles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1753248935\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TECHNICAL DETAILS!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.poster.avif?t=1753248935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.webm?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9f8541419ecbe61535f3389a681158a7.mp4?t=1753248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ygg Engine includes the Ygg game client, Ygg game server, and Ygg realm editor.<br></li><li> Ygg Engine runs as a client and server, which can be limited to single-player or opened for multi-player<br></li><li> You can host public Ygg game servers that others can join<br></li>